- if @issues.count.zero?
  .text-center.mt-16
    .sad-mark.text-7xl
      i.fa-regular.fa-face-sad-tear
    .font-medium.text-2xl.pt-4
      | 成果物が見つかりませんでした
- else
  .w-fit.ml-auto.mb-1.pr-3
    = "全 #{ @issues.count } 件"
  .border-t.border-gray-400
    = render partial: 'repositories/issues/issue', collection: @issues

